<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 182-4 V SOMERSET 284 AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 182-4 V SOMERSET 284 AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>TAUNTON, England 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 182-4 in</p>
<p>reply to Somerset's first innings score of 284 at the close on</p>
<p>the first day of a four-day tour match on Friday.</p>
</text>
